1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Good morning! Did you sleep well?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Not really, the neighbour was loud.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Again? What did he do?

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
He played the piano at three o'clock.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,500
At three in the morning?

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Yes, and not particularly well.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Do you want a coffee?

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Yes please, with a little milk.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Unfortunately we're out of milk.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Then I'll quickly go shopping.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Take an umbrella with you!

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,500
But it isn't raining at all.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,500
Not yet. Look out the window.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Oh, the clouds are pretty dark.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,500
See? I'm always right.

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,500
Almost always.

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Please also buy bread and cheese.

18
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Anything else?

19
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,500
No, that's all. Thanks!

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,500
See you soon!

